        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>议论文模板示范 手写笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #f2f1ec;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fbfaf5;\n    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      to bottom,\n      transparent 0px,\n      transparent 25px,\n      #cfd6e0 25px,\n      #cfd6e0 26px\n    );\n    background-position: 0 60px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    padding: 0 34px 40px 34px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .header {\n    padding-top: 8px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    color: #4a5b8c;\n    font-size: 9px;\n  }\n  .header .field {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #6c7fae;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    padding-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .notes {\n    color: #1b2a6b;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 26px;\n  }\n  ul.bullets {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 6px 0 0 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  ul.bullets > li {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 16px;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  ul.bullets > li::before {\n    content: \"\\2022\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n  }\n  .heading-red {\n    color: #b8332b;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    line-height: 26px;\n  }\n  .group-title {\n    color: #1b2a6b;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 26px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n  ol.items {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    color: #1b2a6b;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 26px;\n  }\n  ol.items > li {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 22px;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  ol.items > li > .num {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n  }\n  .faint-block {\n    color: #b9b6ae;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 26px;\n    text-align: right;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 34px;\n    bottom: 8px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    color: #3d5aa8;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n  .spacer {\n    height: 26px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"field\">No.</div>\n    <div class=\"field\">Date</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"notes\">\n    <ul class=\"bullets\">\n      <li>从神舟一号到神舟十六号，我们“天高地迥，觉宇宙之无穷”。</li>\n      <li>鲜艳的五星红旗在浩瀚的宇宙星空中徐徐飘扬，向世人展示，我们的征途是星辰大海。</li>\n      <li>九霄逐梦再问天，阔步强国新征程。</li>\n      <li>特提天上银河水，散作甘霖润九州。</li>\n      <li>从一张张年轻而沉稳、从容而自信的航天人面孔，窥见的是中国航天的精神密码。</li>\n      <li>探索浩瀚宇宙，是梦想的远航，也是创新的跋涉。</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"heading-red\">议论文模板示范：</div>\n\n  <div class=\"group-title\">第一组：</div>\n  <ol class=\"items\">\n    <li><span class=\"num\">1：</span>从“飞天之梦”中读懂坚定理想的赤子之心，永葆“九万里风鹏正举”的笃定精神。</li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">2：</span>从“问天之间”中读懂求真求知的探索之心，胸怀“若将上下而求索”的开拓意识。</li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">3：</span>从“天宫之吻”中读懂踏而行之的进取之心，砥砺“不破楼兰终不还”的实干担当。</li>\n  </ol>\n\n  <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"group-title\">第二组：</div>\n  <ol class=\"items\">\n    <li><span class=\"num\">1：</span>学习“特别能吃苦”的精神，铸就“梅花香自苦寒来”的信念之魂，做艰苦奋斗的“追梦人”。</li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">2：</span>学习“特别能战斗”的精神，铸就“千磨万击还坚韧”的斗争之魂，做越挫越勇的“追梦人”。</li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">3：</span>学习“特别能攻关”的精神，铸就“吾将上下而求索”的创新之魂，做开拓向前的“追梦人”。</li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">4：</span>学习“特别能奉献”的精神，铸就“岂因祸福避趋之”的担当之魂，做无怨无悔的“追梦人”。</li>\n  </ol>\n\n  <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"faint-block\">\n    [illegible]<br>\n    [illegible]<br>\n    [illegible]\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">Campus</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
